Wine 11.0, the wineserver sources and the headers they include, the
l_intl.nls case table the server loads at startup, and the system call table
dlls/ntdll/ntsyscalls.h that numbers the calls ntdll.dll makes.
Source: https://dl.winehq.org/wine/source/11.0/wine-11.0.tar.xz
SHA-256: c07a6857933c1fc60dff5448d79f39c92481c1e9db5aa628db9d0358446e0701
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later; see COPYING.LIB and AUTHORS.

The files are unmodified. server/main.c and the process tracing back ends
(mach.c, ptrace.c, procfs.c) are left out; crates/adv-wineserver/c provides
the startup and platform functions they define, the configuration header and
the host services the server calls.
